# Session 3: real third-party ontologies, fetched not committed.
# The whole folder used to be ignored, but this lab's own verified
# reference outputs (reasoned.ttl, report.tsv, and the copy of
# scro-extension-reference.ttl fetch_ontologies.py places here) also
# land in workspace/, and a blanket ignore silently dropped them too.
# This is now a run-and-observe lab, not an authoring one, so these are
# not student deliverables, they are the instructor's own checked-in
# example of what a clean run of this pipeline produces. Ignore the
# fetched third-party material by default, then explicitly un-ignore
# the three files worth keeping in the repository.
session-03-ontology/workspace/*
!session-03-ontology/workspace/scro-extension-reference.ttl
!session-03-ontology/workspace/reasoned.ttl
!session-03-ontology/workspace/report.tsv

# Generated graphs and reports, regenerate, do not commit
*.ttl.bak
profiling_report_*.html

# OS and editor
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

